 oy Curtis\, his best friend Johnny Cade and their Greaser family of &lsquo
 \;outsiders&rsquo\; battle with their affluent rivals\, the Socs. <em>The 
 Outsiders</em> navigates the complexities of self-discovery as the Greaser
 s dream about who they want to become in a world that may never accept the
 m. With a dynamic original score\, <em>The Outsiders</em> is a story of fr
 iendship\, family\, belonging&hellip\;and the realization that there is st
 ill &ldquo\;lots of good in the world.&rdquo\;</p>
