 \, orchestration\, and arrangements by Justin Levine\, choreography by Ric
 k Kuperman &amp\; Jeff Kuperman\, and direction by Tony Award&reg\; winner
  Danya Taymor. The <em>New York Post</em> calls it &ldquo\;The Best New Mu
 sical of the Season.&rdquo\;<br /><br />In Tulsa\, Oklahoma\, 1967\, Ponyb
 oy Curtis\, his best friend Johnny Cade and their Greaser family of &lsquo
 \;outsiders&rsquo\; battle with their affluent rivals\, the Socs. <em>The 
